OL,3,GNEWSATeen sentenced for killing rider
OL,4,Aat car meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speeding teenage driver who killed an
OL,7,Foncoming motorbike rider at an
OL,8,Funofficial car meet has been given a
OL,9,Fsuspended sentence.
OL,11,FJack Appleton was 17 when he struck
OL,12,F29-year-old Andrew Robson on Spring
OL,13,FRoad in Murton, County Durham, at an
OL,14,Festimated 70mph in September 2024,
OL,15,FTeesside Crown Court heard.
OL,17,FThe victim's partner, with whom he had
OL,18,Fa young daughter, said their life plans
OL,19,Fhad been destroyed, while his mother
OL,20,Fsaid she had been "tortured every
OL,21,Fsingle day" by his death.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
