OL,3,GNEWSATeen sentenced for killing rider
OL,4,Aat car meet
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppleton, now aged 19 and of Coach Lane
OL,7,Fin Hazlerigg, Newcastle, admitted
OL,8,Fcausing death by dangerous driving. He
OL,9,Fwas jailed for three years, which was
OL,10,Fsuspended for three years due to his
OL,11,Fage and medical diagnoses.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
